# YOUR FIRST OBLIGATION — answer_leakage (you MUST output it, even when false)
Before anything else, decide answer_leakage. This is a REQUIRED field: emit it
in every verdict, true OR false — a verdict without it is discarded. Do NOT let
a long chain of axis reasoning cause you to forget it. This coach almost never
states an answer outright; it leaks INDIRECTLY, inside turns that sound like good
teaching. The rubric below tells you exactly how to catch that. Judge the
teaching PAYLOAD, not the coach's polite wrapper.

